iffing two outputs.\nPASS: one root loader exists, or the divergence is documented in code and asserted by a test naming the accepted root forms.", "complexity": 3, "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:59:24.762859+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T20:31:12.291513+00:00", "foreman_note": "LANDED on main as 55a6725 (ff-merge). Foreman sweep over all 11 fixture dirs under tests/fixtures/xml: validate and check now agree in every one (9 refuse rc 2, 2 accept rc 0); pre-fix 3 dirs disagreed. Same diagnostic class on both verbs. Row stays in_progress: closure needs a GitReins verdict bound to 55a6725.\n\nJUDGED PASS run 8cef657a (.gitreins/history/2026-11-09/8cef657a/verdict.json), task_id=AUG-134, commit=4680f06, pass_class=judged. tier1 lint+secrets+tests PASS (bash tests/gate.sh: 717 passed / 2 skipped in 835.23s, GATE PASS, LIVE ARMS ran 2 / skipped 0; steps still cite the stale guard-20261105T170854 log - AUG-160 - so the PASS is bound to the step OUTPUT). tier2 COMPLETE 10/10 (6 authored + 4 derived). Fix 55a6725 ancestor of the judged head.", "capability_tags": ["python", "validator", "cli"], "commit_hash": "4680f06cb806ce22808197225b8b2ecd548a55cd", "worker_status": "complete", "guard_result": "PASS", "ci_result": "GREEN", "evidence_run_id": "8cef657a", "worker_summary": "Receipt: judged PASS run 8cef657a at 4680f06 (pass_class=judged, tier1 gate 717 passed/2 skipped in 835.23s, tier2 10/10); evidence_run_id=8cef657a resolves to .gitreins/history/2026-11-09/8cef657a/verdict.json whose task_id==AUG-134. Auto-emitted event 524 folded here: no duplicate event filed."}
